    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20377" root="سلح" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُلَحٌ</span></b>  The <i>young of the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَجَل</span> [or <i>partridge</i>];
(S, K;) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُلَكٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُلَفٌ</span>: (S:) [a coll. gen. n.:
n. un. with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>: for] it is said in the T that <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُلَحَةٌ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُلَكَةٌ</span> signify the <i>young one of the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَجَل</span>: (TA:)
pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِلْحَانٌ</span>, (T, S, K,) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِلْكَانٌ</span>. (T, TA.)

